s="sb-text" style="color:#0E2A24;font-family:&#x27;Iowan Old Style&#x27;, &#x27;Palatino Linotype&#x27;, Georgia, serif;font-size:30px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:36px;margin:0 0 16px">You&#x27;ve been added to Platform</h1><p class="sb-muted" style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#3D554F;margin:0 0 24px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:24px;margin-left:0">Grace Hopper added you to Platform on SurveyBeat. The team uses it for short, regular check-ins on how everyone is doing.</p><a class="sb-button" href="https://app.surveybeat.app/" style="line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#0E2A24;border-radius:12px;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;padding:14px 24px;padding-top:14px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:14px;padding-left:24px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:21px" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:10.5px">Open SurveyBeat</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p class="sb-muted" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#3D554F;margin:24px 0 0;margin-top:24px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">If the button does not work, open this link:<!-- --> <a class="sb-link" href="https://app.surveybeat.app/" style="color:#0B5D55;text-decoration-line:none;word-break:break-all" target="_blank">https://app.surveybeat.app/</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr class="sb-rule" style="width:100%;border:none;border-color:transparent;border-top:1px solid #E1E5E1;margin:24px 0 12px"/><p class="sb-muted" style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#3D554F;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">You received this email because Grace Hopper added you to Platform.</p><p class="sb-muted" style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#3D554F;margin:4px 0 0;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">SurveyBeat helps teams check in on how they are doing, a few questions at a time.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
`;

