exports[`InvitationEmail > renders the subject, HTML, and plain-text parts > subject 1`] = `"Weekly Pulse"`;

exports[`InvitationEmail > renders the subject, HTML, and plain-text parts > text 1`] = `
"Weekly Pulse

Your lead only sees combined answers from at least 4 people, never who answered what. Your name is never stored with your answers.

How was your week?

1 (Dreadful): https://app.surveybeat.app/a#t=test-token-123&v=1
2: https://app.surveybeat.app/a#t=test-token-123&v=2
3: https://app.surveybeat.app/a#t=test-token-123&v=3
4: https://app.surveybeat.app/a#t=test-token-123&v=4
5 (Energising): https://app.surveybeat.app/a#t=test-token-123&v=5

Open check-in: https://app.surveybeat.app/a#t=test-token-123

Team actions in progress
• Keep pairing sessions short
• Update onboarding docs

Change when I get this: https://app.surveybeat.app/delivery?token=test-token-123
This link is personal. Don't forward it.

--
You received this email because you are a member of the team.
SurveyBeat helps teams check in on how they are doing, a few questions at a time.
"
`;

